00:31:11.360 --> 00:31:15.060
like cost plus
customer satisfaction?

00:31:15.060 --> 00:31:16.060
RALPH ASHER: Yeah, yeah.

00:31:16.060 --> 00:31:20.680
And so you can kind of shape
your objective function

00:31:20.680 --> 00:31:24.620
to reflect whatever combined
metric you may care about.

00:31:24.620 --> 00:31:27.820
So in this case, the objective
function that you saw

00:31:27.820 --> 00:31:30.130
was purely a cost function.

00:31:30.130 --> 00:31:34.660
But I've in the past done things
