Thank you.

00:55:39.500 --> 00:55:43.180
Another question from
Slido was what type of data

00:55:43.180 --> 00:55:44.740
are you forecasting on?

00:55:44.740 --> 00:55:47.770
Invoice sales, demand, POS?

00:55:47.770 --> 00:55:48.770
LAURA ROSE: Demand data.

00:55:48.770 --> 00:55:50.800
So we have two divisions.

00:55:50.800 --> 00:55:54.690
Yeah, invoice sales,
