00:56:02.480 --> 00:56:04.610
So we sell business to business.

00:56:04.610 --> 00:56:08.560
So we supply a lot of the
pharmaceutical companies you

00:56:08.560 --> 00:56:10.280
probably heard of in the news.

00:56:10.280 --> 00:56:12.680
And that's all I
can say about that.

00:56:12.680 --> 00:56:16.960
And then we also supply
some distributor pharmacies,

00:56:16.960 --> 00:56:18.400
and that's our dosage product.

00:56:18.400 --> 00:56:20.530
So the kind of
stuff that you might

00:56:20.530 --> 00:56:27.810
get prescribed for pain
management or other conditions.

00:56:27.810 --> 00:56:29.720
RACHEL: Thank you.

00:56:29.720 --> 00:56:32.630
But Laura, one question was,
if you had unlimited budget,

00:56:32.630 --> 00:56:35.360
would you prefer,
one, modeling in R

00:56:35.360 --> 00:56:39.980
and then passing results to
Tableau, or two, modeling

00:56:39.980 --> 00:56:43.750
and displaying in R and Shiny?

00:56:43.750 --> 00:56:48.370
LAURA ROSE: So R and Shiny
