01:09:01.569 --> 01:09:08.050
talk a bit more about compliance
for an in-house application?

01:09:08.050 --> 01:09:09.609
RALPH ASHER: Yeah,
Rachel-- or sorry,

01:09:09.609 --> 01:09:11.470
Laura, would you
